As a group member, you can use email for these actions:

1. Submit a meeting transcript
   Attach one already-produced .vtt transcript per email. Include the group name if you belong
   to more than one group, and mention the meeting date if it is not in the transcript.

2. Add a comment to a meeting
   Reply to that meeting's summary email, keep `group_id=<id>` and `meeting_id=<id>` in the
   subject, and write your comment in the reply body.

3. Log a meeting without a recording
   Include the meeting date and notes in your email. Include the group name if you belong to
   more than one group.

These actions are limited to groups associated with your email address. Audio uploads and other
email actions are not available to group members.